{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/1179242e8ee9d50ad4ee4d76f49c3e51.avif?t=1764189140\" width=672 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been hired to work a farm in the isolated town of <strong>Besmirch</strong>. The land is failing, the people are frightened, and the Baron\u2019s tithe grows heavier by the day. Whispers of an apocalypse drift between shuttered windows, and every night unholy monstrosities move beyond the fields. Your task is as simple as it is impossible: keep the town alive long enough to save it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/ae1f03f8bcf20a6b2a3ad5352cf6512b.poster.avif?t=1764189140\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/ae1f03f8bcf20a6b2a3ad5352cf6512b.webm?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/ae1f03f8bcf20a6b2a3ad5352cf6512b.mp4?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/78006381a1874399dcea68f97e0c00aa.avif?t=1764189140\" width=672 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the latest farmhand, you\u2019ll coax crops from barren earth, cook what little you can, and fight tooth and nail to protect every sapling. Each seed struggles to grow, and each harvest is a hard-won victory. Keep a pittance for yourself and share what you can with a town desperate for relief, while still surrendering the Baron\u2019s due. This cursed farm is your lifeline, your burden, and your battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/a5fee54be3b3b6a1640c764a0013cc6d.poster.avif?t=1764189140\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/a5fee54be3b3b6a1640c764a0013cc6d.webm?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/a5fee54be3b3b6a1640c764a0013cc6d.mp4?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/c003ba5b4cfe90574bb44debc3efd34e.avif?t=1764189140\" width=672 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besmirch\u2019s outskirts are riddled with hidden places, buried secrets, forgotten sins. Brave the Baron's crumbling Mansion; scavenging what you can from its haunted depths. Explore while daylight lasts, for when night comes, demons awake.\u00a0You must hurry home, seal the doors, and pray your faith does not fail you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/7f66908169b2b240d79cb887dac16096.poster.avif?t=1764189140\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/7f66908169b2b240d79cb887dac16096.webm?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/7f66908169b2b240d79cb887dac16096.mp4?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/acae84ea902bf2beb9738095a2185705.avif?t=1764189140\" width=672 height=108 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Besmirch pass judgement by omens as much as deeds, and their blessings turn to curses when hunger rises. To stay in their good graces, you must walk carefully between superstition, devotion, and the secrets they refuse to share. With their perception poisoned by desperation, you must prove you are worth more alive than banished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/e26bd7eee222997dfc72bc68bd8fb767.poster.avif?t=1764189140\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/e26bd7eee222997dfc72bc68bd8fb767.webm?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/extras/e26bd7eee222997dfc72bc68bd8fb767.mp4?t=1764189140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xbox Controller support. Mouse and Keyboard may be needed occasionally.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670630?t=1764189140","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/427b74b780651dbc11648882d60393d4aea1ca63/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764189140","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/893fa3744868c6b19a2c1f18114af9e9e894c8f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764189140","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670630/893fa3744868c6b19a2c1f18114af9e